      "text": "This case admits of a scope to be referred to the Special Mediation Drive as the subject matter of the appeal is challenge by the appellant as being the insurer of the offending vehicle with respect to compensation granted by the Motor Accidents Claims Tribunal (MACT), Rajouri in a claim petition on file No. 35/M/.V. Act of 2016 in favour of claimant/respondent No. 1 awarding compensation of Rs. 14,19,800/- with interest, hence, the case admits of scope for settlement by mode of mediation.",
